<title>USA: Exxon plans to develop field off Norway.</title>
<headline>Exxon plans to develop field off Norway.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esso Norge AS, an affiliate of Exxon Corp, has submitted a plan to the Norwegian government for the development and operation of the Jotun field, Exxon said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Esso Norge will have more than 40 percent working interest in the development and will operate the production unit, Exxon said.</p>
<p>Jotun is located about 100 miles off the west coast of Norway in 410 feet of water, Exxon said.</p>
